{%- comment -%}
  The logo (owner, 2026-11-03): the cat with the ribbon over KARINEKO, cut from the owner's artwork
  without its VINTAGE and "Pre-owned Luxury Objects" lines. assets/logo-karineko.png is the drawing
  as an alpha mask (723 × 496), painted through CSS in the text colour, so it follows the scroll
  colour like the type.

  height: how tall it is drawn, any CSS length; the width follows.
  row: the cat beside KARINEKO instead of over it (owner, 2026-11-04: the stacked logo was cramped in
  the header). assets/logo-karineko-row.png is the same drawing re-set (843 × 183): the cat at 2.4
  times the height of the letters, the letters as drawn.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign name = settings.brand_name | default: shop.name -%}
{%- if row -%}
  <span class="lockup lockup--row" role="img" aria-label="{{ name | escape }}" style="--lk-h:{{ height | default: '48px' }};--logo:url({{ 'logo-karineko-row.png' | asset_url }})"></span>
{%- else -%}
  <span class="lockup" role="img" aria-label="{{ name | escape }}" style="--lk-h:{{ height | default: '64px' }};--logo:url({{ 'logo-karineko.png' | asset_url }})"></span>
{%- endif -%}
